  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GrannyWeaponTutorial
  menuController: {fileID: 1770882512}
  headingText: {fileID: 1775031440}
  bodyText: {fileID: 2104085112}
  bombFuseSeconds: 2.5
  gripRule: Keep holding the side GRIP button the whole time. If you let go you'll
    drop your weapon, and the noise will reveal your position.
  axeText: 'Swing the axe to strike. Anything it hits gets scratched.

    Get within
    arm''s reach of the prisoner and swing.'
  knifeText: 'Swing or thrust the knife to strike. Anything it hits gets scratched.

    Get
    within arm''s reach of the prisoner and thrust.'
  gunText: 'Aim, then press the front TRIGGER button to shoot.

    Ammo is limited,
    so make every bullet count.'
  bombText: 'Pull the pin out with your other hand to arm the bomb.

    Then throw
    it. The fuse starts when it leaves your hand, and it explodes {fuse} seconds
    later.'
